BT 1 0 0 1 0 34.5 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 15 TL (The given insertion order produced an unbalanced BST with height 5 edges. The search experiment) Tj T* (showed that BST search used fewer comparisons for several of the selected keys, although it was) Tj T* (equal to linear search for some keys.) Tj T* ET
Q
